    {
      "id": "p0116-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Incidentally, because nya also happens to be the sound that cats make in Japanese, some Japanese fans have noted that Papyrus has a cat-like laugh that makes him sound cute.",
